<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">4)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Disposable
                                            waste. These materials have no further use and will be selected by workers and disposed of
                                            by incineration.</span></td>
</tr></table><div>

