2024, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c128" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-25875">20,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares to shareholders at par value of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c128" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-25876">0.0001</ix:nonFraction> per share.</span></p>

