<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Holders
of Class A ordinary shares and Class B ordinary shares have the same rights, except for voting and conversion rights. Each Class A ordinary
share is entitled to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c66" name="us-gaap:CommonStockVotingRights" id="ixv-25884">one</ix:nonNumeric> vote; and each Class B ordinary share is entitled to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c67" name="us-gaap:CommonStockVotingRights" id="ixv-25885">twenty</ix:nonNumeric> votes and is convertible into <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c66" name="us-gaap:CommonStockConversionBasis" id="ixv-25886">one</ix:nonNumeric> Class A ordinary
share at any time by the holder thereof. Class A ordinary shares are not convertible into Class B ordinary shares under any circumstances.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">On
October 10, 2025, the Company completed its Initial Public Offering (&#8220;IPO&#8221;) of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c133" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-25887">2,000,000</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares, par value
