their over-allotment option to purchase an additional <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c135" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-25890">300,000</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares, which closed on October 28, 2025. In aggregate,
the Company issued <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c50" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-25891">2,300,000</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares resulting in total net proceeds of approximately $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c49" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-25892">9.8</ix:nonFraction> million, after deducting underwriting
discounts, commissions, and other offering expenses of approximately $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:NoninterestExpenseOfferingCost" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-25893">1.7</ix:nonFraction> million.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">As
of December 31, 2025, there are <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-25894"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-25895">44,096,040</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c3" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-25896"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c3" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-25897">10,203,960</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> Class B ordinary shares issued and outstanding. As
